## 2. Runtime contract **[obs]**
### 2.1 Init
`CoreComponent.Init` 鈫?`BaseCloth.OnInit` 鈫?`MagicaBoneCloth.ClothInit` (`MagicaCloth_MagicaBoneCloth__ClothInit.c`):
`clothTarget.AddParentTransform()` (registers the *parents* of the roots as read-only bones,
`MagicaCloth_BoneClothTarget__AddParentTransform.c`), then `ClothSetup.ClothInit(team, meshData, clothData,
clothParams, UserFlag)` (`MagicaCloth_ClothSetup__ClothInit.c`). **The `meshData` argument is never referenced** (no
`param_3` use) 鈬?the bone-cloth MeshData is an editor container; the game runs on ClothData + the component lists.
### 2.2 Particles and transforms
* Particle `i` 鈬?`ClothData.useVertexList[i]` = index into `useTransformList`. `CreateParticle` gets flag / depth /
  radius lambdas (`鈥lothSetup___c__DisplayClass2_0___ClothInit_b__0/1/2.c`): flag = `UserFlag(i)` | (selection 2 or 3 鈫?
  Kinematic 0x2 | Step_Update 0x1000000) | (`vertexFlagLevelList[i] & 0x20000` 鈫?TriangleRotation 0x400) |
  Reset_Position 0x2000000; depth = `vertexDepthList[i]`; radius = `clothParams.radius.Evaluate(depth)`.
* `MagicaBoneCloth.UserFlag(i)` (`鈥_UserFlag.c`): `0x4000 Read_Base | 0x20000 Write | 0x100000 Parent` + `0x40000
  Restore` unless `clothTarget.skipRestore` (0x1C) + `0x3000 Read_Pos|Read_Rot` when `selectionData[i] == 2` (Extend is
  *not* treated as fixed here).
* `EnableTeamParticle` 鈫?`MagicaPhysicsManager.SetEnable` (`鈥_SetEnable.c`): `AddBone(UserTransform(i))` with
  `UserTransform(i) = useTransformList[useVertexList[i]]`; `AddRestoreBone(transform, useTransformPositionList[uv[i]],
  useTransformRotationList[uv[i]])`. `useTransformScaleList` has **no reader**.
* Restore (before animation): local pos/rot 鈫?the stored lists. Read (after animation): base pose (all), pos/rot
  (Fixed). Write (`鈥WriteBoneToTransformJob2__Execute.c`): bones whose parent is a registered bone get
  `SetLocalPositionAndRotation` relative to the parent's *new* pose, others `SetPositionAndRotation` 鈬?every particle's
  transform ends exactly at its particle pose; a rotating parent does **not** drag a fixed child.
* `LineWorker.LineRotationJob` (`MagicaCloth_LineWorker_LineRotationJob__Execute.c` l.388): rotates each particle with
  children toward them; Fixed particles are skipped **only if** the team flag 0x4 FixedNonRotation is set
  (`ClothParams.useFixedNonRotation` 0x1D9, `ClothSetup.ClothInit` tail). 鈬?a Fixed root rotates by default; a leaf
  keeps its rest rotation relative to its parent 鈬?**chains need a tip particle** for the last bone to bend (shipped:
  `*_end` / `*_Phy_end` transforms, e.g. tifa B_Skirt `C_SkirtA_c_Phy_end`).
### 2.3 Constraints created by this fork's `ClothSetup.ClothInit`
Spring (`useSpring`), ClampPosition (`useClampPositionLength`), ClampDistance (`useClampDistanceRatio` + rootDistance
lists), RestoreDistance (struct/bend/near lists, any non-empty), RestoreRotation (`useRestoreRotation` + list),
ClampRotation (`useClampRotation` + lists), TriangleBend, collision team flags (`useCollision` 0x20, `isThroat`),
Penetration (`usePenetration` + list), LineWorker (lineRotation lists, `useLineAvarageRotation`), TriangleWorker
(triangleRotation lists), FixedNonRotation. **Not created:** clampDistance2, volume, adjustRotation, edgeCollision.
### 2.4 Hashes / versions
None is read at runtime (13 搂1.0). Shipped values: `dataVersion 6`, `clothDataVersion 5`, `clothSelectionVersion 2`,
`meshDataVersion 2`, hashes arbitrary ints, `clothParamDataHashList` 21 ints (read only by `HasChangedParam`, no
