## 14. MagicaCloth mesh-cloth step model, the patch output in game, numeric readout, butt jiggle (2026-10-26) [obs: decompile 0.5991 + researcher a46f0cfb; in-game numbers: proof/cloth_ab/numeric1, proof/butt_jiggle/live1]
**Step model of one MOVABLE particle** (ForceAndVelocityJob @1804eef30, FixPositionJob @1804edc90, SpringJob @1804e34c0, ClampPositionJob @1804c1300, CopyBoneToParticleJob @1804ecf30; `data/decompiled/all/MagicaCloth_*`):
dt h = 1/60 (Game.InitRendering sets UpdatePerSecond 60), updatePower P = 90/60 = 1.5, steps per frame n = min(4, floor((carry + frameDt)/h)) (surplus dropped), `solverIteration` 1.
Constraint order in one step: ColliderExtrusion, Penetration, ColliderCollision, ClampDistance, Spring, RestoreDistance, RestoreRotation, TriangleBend, ClampPosition, ClampRotation (a constraint exists only if its use* flag was on when the cloth was created).
`pos := old; next = old + h*(v*(1-drag(d))^P + h*a)` (a = gravity/external only; M_Ass: none) -> constraints modify `next` (each adds (1-velocityInfluence)*correction to `pos`) -> `v = clampLen((next-pos)/h, maxVelocity(d)*scale)`, `old = next`.
`basePos` (the skinned virtual vertex, incl. body sliders / gape shapes) does NOT enter the integration; it only enters ClampPosition (ball centre, radius L = limitLength(d)*scale + collisionStretch; hard clamp, NO restoring force, no damping),
Spring (`next += (base-next)*(1-(1-springPower)^P)`; pos is not compensated, so the pull is carried velocity: spring + drag + carried velocity = damped oscillator, f ~ sqrt(s)/(2 pi h), s = 1-(1-p)^1.5: p 0.05 -> 2.6 Hz, 0.10 -> 3.7 Hz, 0.16 -> 4.5 Hz)
and the collision push logic. World influence (once per frame): `old += move*t`, move = displacement of the team centre (ClothParams.influenceTarget: pelvis_CC / spine3_CC / head_CC / neck_CC, re-parented under the animated bones, so skinned bone motion counts),
`t = (1-ign)*(1-worldMoveInfluence) + ign`, `ign = max(0, speed-maxMoveSpeed)/speed`: **maxMoveSpeed 0 -> ign 1 -> t 1 -> the particles follow the team 1:1 = world influence OFF** (all shipped body patches); inertia needs maxMoveSpeed > 0 AND worldMoveInfluence near 1.
BezierParam with useEndValue 0 is the CONSTANT startValue (stored end / curve values are dead); useEndValue 1 = start->end over particle depth (Bezier when useCurveValue).
**Why the shipped patches are quasi-static** (identical in 143 bundles): L = 0 pins every movable particle to basePos each step (+ collisionStretch while a collider pushes: stretch += (0-stretch)*0.2 per step, then max(stretch, penetration)), maxVelocity 0.01 m/s (0.0001 on Breasts/Throat) kills carried velocity,
world influence off, useSpring 0, useGravity 0. No game code writes these parameters at run time (only Girl.UpdateHoleAndPenisConnection toggles team flag 0x40 of the MOUTH team). springRadius/springScale*/springIntensity/springDirectionAtten/springDistanceAtten have no runtime reader.
**Where the patch result lives**: MagicaPhysicsManager.renderPosList (FixedChunkNativeArray<float3>, OBJECT-local to the patch SMR, one chunk per render mesh: RenderMeshState.VertexChunkStart/Length via renderMeshStateDict[deformer.MeshIndex]) + renderVertexBlendList (blend = clamp01((sum of movable-particle link weights - 0.1)/0.9));
Game.PreRender / MainCamera.OnPreRender uploads both and the compute CopyDeformerVertsCompute lerps `skinned[dst] = lerp(skinned[dst], renderPos[src], blend)` into the global skinned buffer: that is why `BakeMesh`/harness diag bakes are PURE SKIN and the cloth only exists on the GPU.
Public managed accessors: `MagicaPhysicsManager.Instance.CopyToRenderMeshWorldData(meshIndex, target, Vector3[] v, n, t)` (world positions; normals/tangents meaningless) and `RenderMeshDeformer.GetEditorPositionNormalTangent(out wpos, out wnor, out wtan, null)`.
**Numeric readout (TfaHairTune plugin v2, `scripts/ingame_test/TfaHairTune`, PRIVATE rig only)**: ops `clothlist`, `clothset` (live edits: clamp, spring, drag, maxVelocity, worldInfl [maxMoveSpeed, moveInfl, rotInfl], maxRotSpeed; read-back returned), `clothtrack` (every frame: BakeMesh skin vs cloth of EVERY vertex of the named
deformers, displacement in actor-local axes, float16 `<out>_<deformer>.bin` [frame][vertex][xyz] + `.skin0.bin` + `<out>.json` with times and the team-centre (pelvis_CC) pose). Drivers: `own/bonecloth/patches/ab/ab_numeric.py` (states + scenes, selftest picks the accessor), `ab_numeric_analyze.py` (tables, heat sheets, k vs q vs k-again pass rule),
`ab_numeric_sheets.py` (camshot side-by-sides), `ab_numeric_session.py` (one game-lock turn: stops the shared rig, starts the private rig with `shion_build/resume/hair_rig_serve.sh`, runs, restarts the shared rig, releases); butt jiggle: `own/bonecloth/bj/` (`particle1d.py` port, `bj_live.py`, `bj_analyze.py`).
